{"3726180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In Hope Voiden", "steam_appid": 3726180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/42ef8d4ad2cfe7aa394cc8342c5843df.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/42ef8d4ad2cfe7aa394cc8342c5843df.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/42ef8d4ad2cfe7aa394cc8342c5843df.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hope Voiden is a first-person survival horror game of permanent death and persistent consequences that puts stakes front and center.  Control a roster of twelve handcrafted characters as you explore the surreal trench ridden hellscape scarred by fanatic beliefs and entropic forces.  Each individual character has a personal mission, unique traits, and only one life. Every action matters. Every failure lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/8d1e666c00e22e017819f30b5e723a1c.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/8d1e666c00e22e017819f30b5e723a1c.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/bf0587d7e7f63fdf7a24ae8798b82dfc.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/bf0587d7e7f63fdf7a24ae8798b82dfc.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/bf0587d7e7f63fdf7a24ae8798b82dfc.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources go beyond the likes of keys or medical supplies and challenge the management of the most fundamental resource of all: Lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single character brings a unique combination of traits and their own ambitions luring them deeper into the zone. Whether they will find their son, redeem their faith, cleanse their name or betray their command depends on you. Will you die a coward? Or become a martyr? Every action matters because the stakes are real and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/e6d85432adbb0d28afaa123504fcf4b5.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/e6d85432adbb0d28afaa123504fcf4b5.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/dd7e548c341b021cf795bab289cc5756.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/dd7e548c341b021cf795bab289cc5756.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/dd7e548c341b021cf795bab289cc5756.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistence permeates the world. Items used are gone, progress is carried over, and past failures shape the present. The world offers a multitude of interactions unique to characters, their traits and your approach to impeding obstacles. Will you face the danger head on? Flee and find a way around? Or hide and pray for the best? All culminating in handcrafted epilogues to the story, with every consequence and outcome a valid end to your narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/2d087ae47d2ef18f62153716ffcff3f7.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/2d087ae47d2ef18f62153716ffcff3f7.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/84e9cfd00d99525c9784ffc65378c742.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/84e9cfd00d99525c9784ffc65378c742.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/84e9cfd00d99525c9784ffc65378c742.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory, scavenge and craft. Choose to fight, hide or flee and watch your resources closely. Enemies are disposable at a price, secret shortcuts may require cunning, and the world beckons with deep systems and new takes on familiar formulas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/02693732cb52b5d5c5e64bc8b2f52980.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/02693732cb52b5d5c5e64bc8b2f52980.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/c6e4ed24713e0d57fac6bfcd22dc7d54.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/c6e4ed24713e0d57fac6bfcd22dc7d54.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/c6e4ed24713e0d57fac6bfcd22dc7d54.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth of a place where war broke reality - where relics of trench warfare and fanatical devotion twist into something monstrous. Mysterious signals stem from a forbidden and abandoned zone, explore their origins, uncover lost truths and each character's connection to this forsaken site. Uncover the past haunting “Nullsector Saint Vernant&quot; and explore the twisted fate of its last residents, just days after occupation, mere moments before catastrophe.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/42ef8d4ad2cfe7aa394cc8342c5843df.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/42ef8d4ad2cfe7aa394cc8342c5843df.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/42ef8d4ad2cfe7aa394cc8342c5843df.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hope Voiden is a first-person survival horror game of permanent death and persistent consequences that puts stakes front and center.  Control a roster of twelve handcrafted characters as you explore the surreal trench ridden hellscape scarred by fanatic beliefs and entropic forces.  Each individual character has a personal mission, unique traits, and only one life. Every action matters. Every failure lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/8d1e666c00e22e017819f30b5e723a1c.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/8d1e666c00e22e017819f30b5e723a1c.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/bf0587d7e7f63fdf7a24ae8798b82dfc.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/bf0587d7e7f63fdf7a24ae8798b82dfc.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/bf0587d7e7f63fdf7a24ae8798b82dfc.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources go beyond the likes of keys or medical supplies and challenge the management of the most fundamental resource of all: Lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single character brings a unique combination of traits and their own ambitions luring them deeper into the zone. Whether they will find their son, redeem their faith, cleanse their name or betray their command depends on you. Will you die a coward? Or become a martyr? Every action matters because the stakes are real and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/e6d85432adbb0d28afaa123504fcf4b5.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/e6d85432adbb0d28afaa123504fcf4b5.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/dd7e548c341b021cf795bab289cc5756.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/dd7e548c341b021cf795bab289cc5756.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/dd7e548c341b021cf795bab289cc5756.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistence permeates the world. Items used are gone, progress is carried over, and past failures shape the present. The world offers a multitude of interactions unique to characters, their traits and your approach to impeding obstacles. Will you face the danger head on? Flee and find a way around? Or hide and pray for the best? All culminating in handcrafted epilogues to the story, with every consequence and outcome a valid end to your narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/2d087ae47d2ef18f62153716ffcff3f7.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/2d087ae47d2ef18f62153716ffcff3f7.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/84e9cfd00d99525c9784ffc65378c742.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/84e9cfd00d99525c9784ffc65378c742.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/84e9cfd00d99525c9784ffc65378c742.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory, scavenge and craft. Choose to fight, hide or flee and watch your resources closely. Enemies are disposable at a price, secret shortcuts may require cunning, and the world beckons with deep systems and new takes on familiar formulas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/02693732cb52b5d5c5e64bc8b2f52980.avif?t=1786482808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras_big/02693732cb52b5d5c5e64bc8b2f52980.webp?t=1786482808 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/c6e4ed24713e0d57fac6bfcd22dc7d54.poster.avif?t=1786482808\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/c6e4ed24713e0d57fac6bfcd22dc7d54.webm?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/extras/c6e4ed24713e0d57fac6bfcd22dc7d54.mp4?t=1786482808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth of a place where war broke reality - where relics of trench warfare and fanatical devotion twist into something monstrous. Mysterious signals stem from a forbidden and abandoned zone, explore their origins, uncover lost truths and each character's connection to this forsaken site. Uncover the past haunting “Nullsector Saint Vernant&quot; and explore the twisted fate of its last residents, just days after occupation, mere moments before catastrophe.</p>", "short_description": "A forbidden warzone. Twelve soldiers. One life each. In this first person survival horror, death is permanent and the world remembers. Explore a surreal, trench-ridden hellscape where every action matters - and every death uncovers a new piece of a haunting mystery.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/be4a34d2306b7d5340d9e17800231d65951a8ce4/header.jpg?t=1786482808", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/41e8bca6fc7240909fa646f33a15e52cdd6a4cd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786482808", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726180/41e8bca6fc7240909fa646f33a15e52cdd6a4cd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786482808", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires